---

This product includes software cloned from Harlo
(https://github.com/JosephOIbrahim/Harlo). Hanna's substrate is cloned from
Harlo and specialized for producer-rhythm. See HANNA_BLUEPRINT.md for the
architectural relationship between the two substrates and RULES.md for the
inherited inviolable rules (33 numbered + 8 inquiry safeguards + 4 producer-
specific addenda).

Each cloned file retains its original Apache 2.0 header and adds an
attribution line:

    # Cloned from Harlo (github.com/JosephOIbrahim/Harlo). Specialized for Hanna.

The two repositories share no git history after the initial clone — Hanna
diverges immediately into producer-specific specializations.
